        "text_fqt6KP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Upgrade your traditional protein shakes with Protyze Clear Whey Protein Isolate — a refreshing, fruit-flavoured clear whey protein powder designed for faster absorption, easy digestion, and everyday performance. Our range of clear whey protein and functional whey protein products delivers 15g to 30g protein per serving, supporting muscle recovery, <a href=\"/collections/diet-clear-protein\" title=\"Best Whey Protein for Weight Loss & Gut Health [Whey Protein with Probiotics]\">gut health</a>, lean muscle growth, <a href=\"/collections/hydra-clear-whey-protein\" title=\"Best Protein Electrolyte Drink for Hydration & Recovery in India [Whey Protein With Electrolytes]\">hydration</a>, and daily protein intake without the heaviness of regular whey protein. Made with premium whey protein isolate and advanced formulations featuring probiotics, <a href=\"/collections/nitro-clear-whey-protein\" title=\"Best Whey Protein With Creatine for Muscle Growth & Strength [Protyze Nitro Clear Whey Isolate]\">creatine</a>, electrolytes, and glutamine, Protyze offers some of the best clear whey protein isolate options in India. Manufactured in a GMP Certified facility using a patented process, Protyze Clear Whey is trusted by 50,000+ fitness enthusiasts for clean, effective, and great-tasting protein nutrition.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
